[{"answer":"I live in a two-storey house.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/71-my-house-1-2019-03-29-12-47-04/1.mp3"},{"answer":"The bottom of the house is painted white.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/71-my-house-1-2019-03-29-12-47-04/2.mp3"},{"answer":"The upper part of the house is made of red brick.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/71-my-house-1-2019-03-29-12-47-04/3.mp3"},{"answer":"The chimney is also made of red brick.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/71-my-house-1-2019-03-29-12-47-04/4.mp3"},{"answer":"If you go through the front door and turn right you'll see the living room.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/71-my-house-1-2019-03-29-12-47-04/5.mp3"},{"answer":"The living room is very large and comfortable.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/71-my-house-1-2019-03-29-12-47-04/6.mp3"},{"answer":"There are easy chairs, a coffee table and a sofa in there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/71-my-house-1-2019-03-29-12-47-04/7.mp3"},{"answer":"I like to sit in there and relax.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/71-my-house-1-2019-03-29-12-47-04/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Next to the living room is the dining room.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/71-my-house-1-2019-03-29-12-47-04/9.mp3"},{"answer":"There are a dining table and chairs in there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/71-my-house-1-2019-03-29-12-47-04/10.mp3"},{"answer":"We use this room whenever we have visitors over for dinner.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/71-my-house-1-2019-03-29-12-47-04/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Beside the dining room is the kitchen.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/71-my-house-1-2019-03-29-12-47-04/12.mp3"},{"answer":"The kitchen has a stove and a refrigerator in it","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/71-my-house-1-2019-03-29-12-47-04/13.mp3"},{"answer":"There's also a kitchen table with some benches at it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/71-my-house-1-2019-03-29-12-47-04/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Most of the time we eat in the kitchen.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/71-my-house-1-2019-03-29-12-47-04/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Upstairs there are three bedrooms.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/71-my-house-1-2019-03-29-12-47-04/16.mp3"},{"answer":"My parents' bedroom is very big.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/71-my-house-1-2019-03-29-12-47-04/17.mp3"},{"answer":"They have a large queen-sized bed in there,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/71-my-house-1-2019-03-29-12-47-04/18.mp3"},{"answer":"and there are two closets for their clothes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/71-my-house-1-2019-03-29-12-47-04/19.mp3"},{"answer":"My room is smaller.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/71-my-house-1-2019-03-29-12-47-04/20.mp3"},{"answer":"My room is painted pink,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/71-my-house-1-2019-03-29-12-47-04/21.mp3"},{"answer":"and I have ruffled curtains on the windows.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/71-my-house-1-2019-03-29-12-47-04/22.mp3"},{"answer":"From my bedroom window, you can see the front yard.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/71-my-house-1-2019-03-29-12-47-04/23.mp3"},{"answer":"There is a pine tree in the front yard.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/71-my-house-1-2019-03-29-12-47-04/24.mp3"},{"answer":"My brother's bedroom is painted blue.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/71-my-house-1-2019-03-29-12-47-04/25.mp3"},{"answer":"He has blinds on the windows.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/71-my-house-1-2019-03-29-12-47-04/26.mp3"},{"answer":"He has a bunk bed in his room.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/71-my-house-1-2019-03-29-12-47-04/27.mp3"},{"answer":"If he has a friend stay over,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/71-my-house-1-2019-03-29-12-47-04/28.mp3"},{"answer":"one of them can sleep on the top bunk,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/71-my-house-1-2019-03-29-12-47-04/29.mp3"},{"answer":"and the other can sleep on the bottom bunk.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/71-my-house-1-2019-03-29-12-47-04/30.mp3"},{"answer":"You can see the backyard from his bedroom window.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/71-my-house-1-2019-03-29-12-47-04/31.mp3"},{"answer":"There are rose bushes and a picnic table in the backyard.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/71-my-house-1-2019-03-29-12-47-04/32.mp3"},{"answer":"There is also a white fence that has a gate in it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/71-my-house-1-2019-03-29-12-47-04/33.mp3"},{"answer":"In the basement there is a recreation room.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/71-my-house-1-2019-03-29-12-47-04/34.mp3"},{"answer":"This is where we watch television and have friends over to visit.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/71-my-house-1-2019-03-29-12-47-04/35.mp3"},{"answer":"The laundry room is also in the basement.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/71-my-house-1-2019-03-29-12-47-04/36.mp3"},{"answer":"There's a washing machine and a dryer in there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/71-my-house-1-2019-03-29-12-47-04/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Beside our house is a garage.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/71-my-house-1-2019-03-29-12-47-04/38.mp3"},{"answer":"We keep the car in the garage whenever the weather is bad.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/71-my-house-1-2019-03-29-12-47-04/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Our house is just the right size for our family.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/71-my-house-1-2019-03-29-12-47-04/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Friends are always welcome at our house.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/71-my-house-1-2019-03-29-12-47-04/41.mp3"}]
